[ dai2022a_fig9: Sauropod strict consensus. Branches read from the raster's lines with a run-length reader (connected at tolerance 6 px) and checked against the figure at the Neosauropoda backbone and the collinear stems in Macronaria; tip names from the PDF text layer, paired to the tips by height (all within 7 px). Sauropoda, Neosauropoda and Macronaria are printed beside node dots and kept as internal labels. 88 tips, 9 polytomies (4, 3, 5, 4, 3, 21, 6, 6, 3 children); 3 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

